rcomputer, Grosser. But when Grosser decides to take over the world, a savior is needed!\n\nA computer-illiterate girl named Yui Kasuga happens upon software program IR, which recruits her as savior of Comnet and pulls her into the virtual world inside. There, Yui is given the power to become Corrector Yui so that she can fight against Grosser and his evil Corruptors.\n\nInside the virtual world for the first time, Yui must face one of Grosser's henchmen. She must also battle another of Grosser's minions, this time one who's infecting the e-mail passed between Yui and her friends. And finally, Yui and IR suspect foul play when Chef Kirch, a family friend who can never get his recipes quite right, has to face customers who've turned into ravenous zombies!\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)"},"tags":[{"name":"Virtual World","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Video Games","rank":26,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Corrector Yui","english":"Corrector Yui","native":"コレクター・ユイ","romaji":"Corrector Yui","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"コレクター・ユイ 第1シリーズ"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"网络安琪儿 第一期"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"コレクター・ユイ 第1期"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Cyber守护星 第一期"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"修正者阿结 第一期"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Collector Yui 1st Season"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}